1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,500
Every loan, every account, every KYC check starts with documents.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:10,620
And almost every system that reads them has the same blind spot.

3
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:12,060
This is TruthLens.

4
00:00:13,546 --> 00:00:16,680
OCR turns a scanned document into clean text.

5
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:21,624
A swapped photograph, an overwritten date of birth, a doctored address,

6
00:00:21,624 --> 00:00:26,360
an inflated salary — all of it comes out looking like ordinary text.

7
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:31,026
The data is extracted, and the fraud goes straight through the gap.

8
00:00:31,512 --> 00:00:34,693
TruthLens closes that gap with three moves.

9
00:00:34,693 --> 00:00:36,099
Observe the pixels.

10
00:00:36,099 --> 00:00:37,875
Correlate the documents.

11
00:00:37,875 --> 00:00:39,503
Explain every finding.

12
00:00:39,503 --> 00:00:41,870
Seven steps run on every upload:

13
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:46,384
ingest and classify, OCR, structure fields, visual forensics,

14
00:00:46,384 --> 00:00:51,933
contextual checks, cross-document correlation, and evidence with a dossier.

15
00:00:51,933 --> 00:00:55,632
Every step is written to a hash-chained audit log.

16
00:00:56,118 --> 00:00:58,250
Here is the working prototype.

17
00:00:58,250 --> 00:01:01,092
It ships with a synthetic tampered case:

18
00:01:01,092 --> 00:01:06,351
an application form, an ID card and a bank statement, all fully fictional.

19
00:01:06,351 --> 00:01:09,478
One click, and the pipeline runs in seconds.

20
00:01:09,964 --> 00:01:13,003
Ten findings come back, labelled Observed,

21
00:01:13,003 --> 00:01:15,825
Inconsistent or Potential manipulation.

22
00:01:15,825 --> 00:01:17,416
Never confirmed fraud.

23
00:01:17,416 --> 00:01:21,251
The application form says twelve oh four, ninety-one.

24
00:01:21,251 --> 00:01:24,435
Both other documents say twenty-one oh four.

25
00:01:24,435 --> 00:01:29,065
The address reads Pune on two documents and Mumbai on the third.

26
00:01:29,065 --> 00:01:31,163
Nine point six lakh declared,

27
00:01:31,163 --> 00:01:35,143
against four point one lakh of annualised bank credits.

28
00:01:35,143 --> 00:01:39,484
And every card traces back to the exact pixels it came from.

29
00:01:40,370 --> 00:01:44,383
Underneath, the forensic engine measures compression error,

30
00:01:44,383 --> 00:01:48,056
noise-floor breaks, font drift, copy-move duplication,

31
00:01:48,056 --> 00:01:51,252
signature placement and photo-region anomalies.

32
00:01:51,252 --> 00:01:54,925
When two independent signals agree on the same pixels,

33
00:01:54,925 --> 00:01:59,210
the finding is escalated, and the explanation says exactly why.

34
00:01:59,696 --> 00:02:04,864
The matrix lines up every field across every document, tolerant of initials,

35
00:02:04,864 --> 00:02:06,564
spacing and date formats.

36
00:02:06,564 --> 00:02:10,168
A reviewer confirms, flags or dismisses each finding,

37
00:02:10,168 --> 00:02:13,296
and that decision is timestamped in the chain.

38
00:02:13,782 --> 00:02:16,863
The audit trail is a SHA-256 hash chain.

39
00:02:16,863 --> 00:02:20,330
Edit any past entry, and verification breaks.

40
00:02:20,330 --> 00:02:23,797
One click produces the investigation dossier:

41
00:02:23,797 --> 00:02:27,418
file hashes, extracted fields, the full matrix,

42
00:02:27,418 --> 00:02:30,422
and cropped evidence for every finding.

43
00:02:30,908 --> 00:02:33,109
Not everything is a red flag.

44
00:02:33,109 --> 00:02:36,524
The genuine sample produces a clean baseline.

45
00:02:36,524 --> 00:02:39,180
And the capability table is honest:

46
00:02:39,180 --> 00:02:43,733
OCR, forensics, correlation and the dossier are implemented.

47
00:02:43,733 --> 00:02:47,148
Handwriting and multilingual OCR are planned.

48
00:02:47,634 --> 00:02:51,696
Faster KYC reviews, fewer forged applications,

49
00:02:51,696 --> 00:02:55,758
and an evidence trail that stands up to audit.

50
00:02:55,758 --> 00:02:56,641
TruthLens:

51
00:02:56,641 --> 00:02:59,114
observe, correlate, explain.
